          "beginner": "Try making the \"ㄲ\" sound.",
          "intermediate": "Find a word that starts with \"ㄲ\".",
          "advanced": "Understanding the position and method of pronouncing \"ㄲ\" enables accurate pronunciation.",
          "master": "The phonological characteristics of \"ㄲ\" are central to the Korean pronunciation system."
        },
        "variations": {
